&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and grow a team of Analytics Engineers focused on building a scalable, reliable, and well-documented data foundation while fostering a culture of collaboration and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and operationalize a unified semantic layer with canonical datasets, enforced modeling standards, lineage graphs, query corpus, and business context that powers self-serve analytics at scale, conversational data access, and advanced analytics with maintained governance and trustworthiness.&lt;/li&gt;
