&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Webflow is the agentic web marketing platform for modern marketing teams, helping organizations build, manage, and optimize high-performing web experiences that drive predictable growth and strengthen brand trust. Building at Webflow will need grit, because we move fast, without ever sacrificing craft or quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a contract &lt;strong&gt;Paid Social Specialist&lt;/strong&gt; to own day-to-day execution and optimization across LinkedIn (primary) and Meta (secondary). This is a hands-on, in-platform role. Strategy, budget allocation, and cross-functional direction sit with the growth marketing manager you&#39;ll report to — your job is to take approved briefs and turn them into well-built, well-optimized, well-measured campaigns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be measured on pipeline pull-through, not activity. If you like being accountable to downstream numbers and have opinions about why a campaign is or isn&#39;t converting, you&#39;ll do well here.&lt;/p&gt;
