&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will take meaningful ownership in advancing our frameworks, tools, and operating models, helping shape how Webflow communicates and quantifies business value for customers. You&#39;ll own value realization planning through the full customer lifecycle, from success planning at onboarding through strategic renewals and expansion opportunities, ensuring customers realize measurable value from Webflow while contributing directly to NDR and revenue growth. You’ll have significant autonomy in how you approach this work, while aligning closely to the broader program strategy and direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position is ideal for someone who thrives in a high trust, collaborative environment: someone who enjoys meaningful ownership, brings fresh ideas forward, and contributes to a growing program at an accelerating company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Remote-first (United States; BC &amp;amp; ON, Canada)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exempt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our cash compensation amount for this role ranges depending on the cost of labor of the geographic area. The ranges shared below may change if you are hired in another geographic location.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
