&lt;li&gt;United States&amp;nbsp; (all figures cited below in USD and pertain to workers in the United States)
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone A: $178,500 - $210,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone B: $166,500 - $196,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Zone C: $156,500 - $184,000&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
