&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application deadline: applications accepted on an ongoing basis until position is closed and filled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This posting is for an existing vacancy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting to the VP, Revenue Marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Marketing Manager, Web Growth, you&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own web optimization and A/B testing in partnership with the demand-gen team.&lt;/strong&gt; Run a structured, high-velocity experimentation program on webflow.com — hypothesis to live test to statistically valid result — using our experimentation and personalization stack (Webflow Optimize and equivalents). Set the test roadmap, defend statistical rigor, and turn win rate and conversion lift into reported KPIs, not anecdotes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the web-side execution of AEO in partnership with the AEO lead.&lt;/strong&gt; The AEO lead owns methodology, measurement, and category strategy; you own what makes webflow.com win citations and manage site performance improvements, accessibility, site architecture best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are the AEO lead&#39;s trusted site-side partner — the one who turns their strategy into live citation wins on webflow.com.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run webflow.com as a &quot;living&quot; website, not a project that ships and stops.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the continuous development of the site — page and component build, design QA, performance, and iteration velocity — so the site is always evolving in-platform. This is the customer-zero narrative made real: Webflow on Webflow, demonstrated through webflow.com, built and optimized on our own product every day.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn &lt;a href=&quot;http://webflow.com&quot;&gt;webflow.com&lt;/a&gt; into an account-level pipeline engine. Lead the on-brand experimentation, personalization stack, and conversion architecture that converts ICP-matched traffic into qualified pipeline. Partner closely with Demand Gen to ensure web experiences reflect and reinforce active sales-led pipeline initiatives (ABM target accounts, named-account journeys, and campaign-specific landing experiences).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and ship,beyond building briefs.&lt;/strong&gt; Design, build, and ship landing pages and site experiences end to end in-platform — you&#39;re hands-on in the product, closing the loop from hypothesis to live page yourself rather than handing specs to a queue. &lt;em&gt;(Anthropic growth-engineer archetype: high agency, technical hands-on build.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the web measurement layer.&lt;/strong&gt; Instrument event tracking, funnel analytics, and attribution for site-sourced pipeline so every experiment and every AEO/answer-engine visit is measurable end to end — and so web&#39;s contribution to pipeline is provable, not asserted. &lt;em&gt;(Profound archetype: answer-engine visibility instrumented as a measurable funnel.)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support campaign orchestration across the web as a channel.&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t own or operate the orchestration engine — you represent webflow.com as a coordinated channel within it. Wire site behavior signals and on-site responses into the cross-channel play, and execute the web slice of an orchestrated account motion so a single account signal (AEO citation, site behavior, paid engagement) triggers a coordinated web response, not a siloed one. Partner with Marketing Ops, RevOps, and the AI-native team who own the orchestration layer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive opportunities for Sales as the north star,&lt;/strong&gt; instrumenting the signal-to-pipeline feedback loop that makes intent signals a stronger conversion predictor than firmographic ICP rating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner cross-functionally as a peer&lt;/strong&gt; to Demand Gen, Partner Marketing, PMM, and the broader Revenue org, protecting scope clarity while making Growth Platforms the substrate the entire Revenue Marketing org runs on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and optimize a high-traffic B2B SaaS marketing website as a product&lt;/strong&gt;, driving continuous improvements across user experience, performance, conversion, and experimentation rather than managing one-off website projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and lead a mature experimentation program&lt;/strong&gt;, establishing testing strategy, experimentation infrastructure, and best practices while delivering measurable improvements in conversion and pipeline through statistically rigorous testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring deep expertise in technical SEO and Answer Engine Optimization (AEO)&lt;/strong&gt;, implementing structured data, crawlability, site architecture, and content optimizations that increase both organic search visibility and AI-powered answer engine discoverability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leverage marketing analytics to drive business outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;, implementing instrumentation, funnel analytics, attribution, and measurement frameworks that demonstrate marketing&#39;s contribution to qualified pipeline and revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply AI to production growth workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, deploying AI agents and automation to improve content, routing, personalization, and optimization while maintaining appropriate human oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
