&lt;p&gt;Webflow is the agentic web marketing platform for modern marketing teams, helping organizations build, manage, and optimize high-performing web experiences that drive predictable growth and strengthen brand trust. Building at Webflow will need grit, because we move fast, without ever sacrificing craft or quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Partner Solutions Engineer (PSE) that will be a strategic technical enablement partner focused on building, validating, and scaling the technical capabilities of Webflow’s agency and services partners. This role ensures partners are equipped to confidently sell, design, and deliver high-quality Webflow solutions for complex and enterprise-grade use cases—while maintaining clear boundaries that enable scale and predictability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the technical counterpart to Partner Account Managers (PAMs), the PSE team supports multiple partner portfolios and works closely with Partner Enablement, Sales, and Customer Solutions Engineering to strengthen partner readiness and improve the quality of partner-sourced opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Remote-first (United States or BC, Canada)
